  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/10/IMG_7162.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El caf&eacute; rock La Oveja Negra, en la calle Mallorca, 25-esquina Sicilia, de Onda ha acogido la tarde-noche de este s&aacute;bado, 11 de octubre, la fiesta del gorro organizada por la Penya Tombats, que ha estado muy animada.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fesdtagorrotombatsovejanegra/img_7154.jpg\" alt=\"img_7154\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fesdtagorrotombatsovejanegra/img_7155.jpg\" alt=\"img_7155\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fesdtagorrotombatsovejanegra/img_7156.jpg\" alt=\"img_7156\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fesdtagorrotombatsovejanegra/img_7157.jpg\" alt=\"img_7157\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fesdtagorrotombatsovejanegra/img_7158.jpg\" alt=\"img_7158\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fesdtagorrotombatsovejanegra/img_7159.jpg\" alt=\"img_7159\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fesdtagorrotombatsovejanegra/img_7160.jpg\" alt=\"img_7160\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fesdtagorrotombatsovejanegra/img_7161.jpg\" alt=\"img_7161\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fesdtagorrotombatsovejanegra/img_7162.jpg\" alt=\"img_7162\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a